+ * is a raw count of every real __switch_to() invocation. ROOT_MOUNT_ATTEMPT
+ * is the last healthy boot point (the root-mount wall is the next failure
+ * this port hits); EXEC_INIT_ATTEMPT documents the intended next stage
+ * after that wall is crossed.
+ */
